 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSvea Logistik AB                                     MASTER SERVICES\nKungsgatan 8, 111 43 Stockholm, Sweden                         AGREEMENT\nMomsreg.nr: SE076884558601\n\nFROM                                                     FAKTURERAS TILL\nSvea Logistik AB                                         Svea Logistik AB\nKungsgatan 8                                             Industrivägen 3\n111 43 Stockholm                                         411 05 Göteborg\nSweden                                                   Sweden\nVAT: SE076884558601\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 2026-05-17 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Svea Logistik AB, with its registered office at Kungsgatan 8, Stockholm (\"Party A\"), and Svea Logistik AB, with\nits registered office at Industrivägen 3, Göteborg (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Svea Logistik AB / Erik Lindqvist\nParty B    Svea Logistik AB / Anna Söderberg\nDate       2026-05-17",
